,"length":732}]}]}],"groundTruthGeneratedCommentsNodes":[{"groundTruth":{"original_line":383,"line":383,"comment_lines":["[][383]"],"review_comment":["This looks pretty fragile, what if there\u0027s another field before `_rollup`?\r\n\r\nSince this is fairly infrequent, I\u0027d go with using `sourceAsMap`.","\u003e This looks pretty fragile, what if there\u0027s another field before _rollup?\r\n\r\nI don\u0027t there will be another field. The logic in `TransportPutRollupJobAction#createMappings(...)` always add a `_doc._meta._rollup` field and the `PARSER_CONFIGURATION` constant in `TransportPutRollupJobAction` only allows one field to be present. Let me add some unit tests for this.\r\n\r\n\u003e  I\u0027d go with using sourceAsMap.\r\n\r\nMappings can be pretty large and I like to avoid converting large mappings in map of maps in the jvm heap space. ","In this case, it should throw if there\u0027s another field?\r\n\r\nSorry, did you add a unittest this that I missed?","yes: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/108624/files#diff-1133c63e5149d886f79115c39310aca665afa0b0d0a8ef8aee901440e1e955b7R20","Right, I don\u0027t see a case with multiple fields under `_doc._meta` in this file? ","Ah, I see. I added that now too: 3b2b145afb494d0fb644d7bd08887a7cf5ba908b"],"path":"x-pack/plugin/rollup/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/rollup/action/TransportPutRollupJobAction.java","id":35218,"created_at":"2024-05-17T08:43:38Z","original_position":79,"side":"RIGHT","position":94,"submitted_on_commit":"385119b1887e1603a96c170337d9fd81910ab741","diff_hunk":"@@ -339,6 +367,32 @@ public void onTimeout(TimeValue timeout) {\n         );\n     }\n \n+    private static boolean hasRollupIndices(ClusterState state) throws IOException {\n+        // Sniffing logic instead of invoking sourceAsMap(), which would materialize the entire mapping as map of maps.\n+        for (var imd : state.metadata()) {\n+            if (imd.mapping() \u003d\u003d null) {\n+                continue;\n+            }\n+\n+            try (var parser \u003d XContentHelper.createParser(PARSER_CONFIGURATION, imd.mapping().source().compressedReference())) {\n+                if (parser.nextToken() \u003d\u003d XContentParser.Token.START_OBJECT) {\n+                    if (\"_doc\".equals(parser.nextFieldName())) {\n+                        if (parser.nextToken() \u003d\u003d XContentParser.Token.START_OBJECT) {\n+                            if (\"_meta\".equals(parser.nextFieldName())) {\n+                                if (parser.nextToken() \u003d\u003d XContentParser.Token.START_OBJECT) {\n+                                    if (\"_rollup\".equals(parser.nextFieldName())) {","submitted_line":383},"generatedCommentsNodes":[]}],"coveredGroundTruth":0,"uncoveredGroundTruth":1,"coveredMatchable":9,"uncoveredMatchable":2,"timing":40638,"tokensIn":8747,"tokensOut":569}